{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301702","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301702","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230170201:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーだけじゃねぇ。ブラッディ・マリーと死海の艦隊のせいさ。","source_cn":"不止血薇帮。是血薇帮和死潮舰队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03B81F119F86036A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230170202:1":{"text":"海に霧がかかって海獣まで現れたせいで、出航したっきり戻ってきてない船がたくさんあるんだ。","source_cn":"海上弥漫着迷雾，还有海怪出没，使得无数出海的船只至今未回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0FF28DD06E7A034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230170203:1":{"text":"それなのに、ラスティーアンカーに巣食う組織は縄張り争いばかりしてやがる！","source_cn":"而锈锚港的帮派在这种时候却只想着争夺地盘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x708530B00E7F9B21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230170204:1":{"text":"海に出た付き合いの古い友達は誰も帰ってこねぇし、はぁ……","source_cn":"我那些出海的旧友们都没回来，唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x662183E19AA6DE8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:船长布莱杰":{"text":"船長のブラッジェ","source":"船长布莱杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}